# Yoimiya Ororon Fischl Xingqiu. ~24s Rot. (TF) Yoimiya is able to use her skill twice per rotation, with her burst capping the rotation end. 3EM >= EDC Yoimiya. Fischl skill and burst just before Yoimiya skills.

# Team
yoimiya char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
yoimiya add weapon="rust" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
#yoimiya add weapon="hamayumi" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
